    "q-6127": {
      "dom_id": "step-q6127",
      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "What is $170+(-70)?$",
      "worked_solution": "We drop the parentheses and the addition sign to give \n\n$$\n170+(-70)=170-70.\n$$\n\n \n\nThen, we carry out the subtraction as usual. This gives\n \n\n$$\n170-70=100.\n$$",
