      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "What is the value of  $9+(-5.5)?$",
      "worked_solution": "First, we drop the parentheses and the addition sign, which gives\n\n$$\n9+(-5.5)=9-5.5.\n$$\n\nThen, we carry out the subtraction as usual. This gives\n\n$$\n9-5.5=3.5.\n$$",
